{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retronaut Galactic Survivor is a fast-paced, roguelite space shooter where you pilot an ever-evolving starship through hostile galaxies teeming with alien swarms, derelict drones, and cosmic horrors. Blast through endless waves, collect exotic modules, and forge your ship into a one-of-a-kind war machine built for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run pushes you deeper into the unknown\u2014where each galaxy fights back harder, every artifact tells a story, and every upgrade shapes your destiny among the stars.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838920?t=1763574967","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838920/9ebdb7d087fa01a67bebb10993892c3de8af2a1b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763574967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838920/12f4c3f79be5746b0486823d63e5f33c800a5c7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763574967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838920/12f4c3f79be5746b0486823d63e5f33c800a5c7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763574967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retronaut Galactic Survivor is a fast-paced, roguelite space shooter where you pilot an ever-evolving starship through hostile galaxies teeming with alien swarms, derelict drones, and cosmic horrors. Blast through endless waves, collect exotic modules, and forge your ship into a one-of-a-kind war machine built for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run pushes you deeper into the unknown\u2014where each galaxy fights back harder, every artifact tells a story, and every